The household router there.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.924
We can't trail a long
BNC cable from a drone

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:26.592
so we have a Wi-Fi router

00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:29.829 align:start position:0%
