so that's nice.

00:05:32.498 --> 00:05:34.567
The batteries
are powering the drone,

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.602
the router,
the camera and everything,

00:05:36.635 --> 00:05:37.937
so you haven't got
much flight time.

