a water hazard as well.

00:05:53.919 --> 00:05:56.889 align:start position:0%
Yeah. Right, I say
we get it up in the air.

00:05:56.922 --> 00:05:58.124 align:start position:0%
Let's do it.

00:06:00.859 --> 00:06:02.461
That's a lot of money
in the air right now.

00:06:02.494 --> 00:06:03.796
