Probably.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.105
Got it, got it, sweet.

00:06:13.138 --> 00:06:14.573
Bring it back in.
( chuckles )

00:06:14.606 --> 00:06:15.674
Change batteries.

00:06:15.707 --> 00:06:16.976
I like his jacket.

00:06:17.009 --> 00:06:18.677
"Drone pilot, do not interrupt."

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.480
Dan: I want one of those
just for everyday life.

00:06:22.815 --> 00:06:24.417
Oh, yeah, there it is.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.786 align:start position:0%
Nice.

