00:07:28.714 --> 00:07:30.549 line:0%
It makes a difference
being up this high

00:07:30.582 --> 00:07:32.017 line:0%
because we've got
the backdrop of the trees,

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.620 line:0%
