00:08:41.954 --> 00:08:43.155
Oh.

00:08:44.756 --> 00:08:46.191
( sighs )

00:08:46.224 --> 00:08:49.662
We put the camera
in some risky positions before.

00:08:49.695 --> 00:08:51.263
Above a boiling hot geyser

00:08:51.296 --> 00:08:54.233 align:start size:97% position:3%
is probably one of the riskier
places it's ever been.

00:08:57.669 --> 00:08:58.938
Is it playing on there?

00:09:03.842 --> 00:09:06.145
<i> Oh, you can see it coming
 from so far down.</i>

00:09:06.178 --> 00:09:07.846
Dan:
<i> How deep do you think that is?</i>

00:09:07.879 --> 00:09:09.782
Gav:<i> I think it's at least
 40 meters deep.</i>

00:09:09.815 --> 00:09:11.116
<i> It's pretty deep.</i>

00:09:11.149 --> 00:09:13.285
<i> It's like the Earth's sneeze.</i>

00:09:13.318 --> 00:09:14.787
Dan:<i> Yeah.</i>

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.722
Gav:
<i> Yeah, there's the start of it.</i>

00:09:16.755 --> 00:09:19.792
<i> It absolutely
 soaked the camera.</i>

00:09:19.825 --> 00:09:21.694 align:start size:81% position:19%
Water that went all up it.

00:09:21.727 --> 00:09:22.861 align:start size:69% position:31%
And then I was like,
"Get it out of there!"

00:09:22.894 --> 00:09:24.229 align:start size:53% position:47%
And then it
all came on down.

00:09:24.262 --> 00:09:25.931 align:start size:69% position:31%
It was like...
it's getting it again.

00:09:25.964 --> 00:09:27.800
<i> Oh, it was intense.</i>

00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:29.335
<i> It's just complete whiteout.</i>

00:09:29.368 --> 00:09:31.670
Dan:<i> You can see the individual
 drops there still.</i>

00:09:31.703 --> 00:09:34.039
Gav:<i> That's straight
 in the mouth of the camera.</i>

00:09:34.072 --> 00:09:37.042
Dan:<i> Camera doesn't know
 what it's seeing right now.</i>

00:09:37.075 --> 00:09:39.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, I feel very lucky that
we've got all these shots

00:09:39.711 --> 00:09:42.047
and we haven't binned
the camera or the drone.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.849
- Well...
- So...

00:09:43.882 --> 00:09:45.250 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Well, we got it wet.
- Well...

00:09:45.283 --> 00:09:47.686 align:start position:0%
Eh, completely soaked it,
but, yeah.

00:09:47.719 --> 00:09:50.623
But why don't we move
to a different location?

00:09:50.656 --> 00:09:51.891
- Okay. Yeah.
- Sound good?

00:09:53.392 --> 00:09:54.860 line:0%
Well, look at this,
here we are

00:09:54.893 --> 00:09:56.829 line:0%
at a lovely new location.

00:09:56.862 --> 00:09:59.665 line:0%
That's right,
we're at the "Gunfoss..."

00:09:59.698 --> 00:10:00.733
Gun...

00:10:00.766 --> 00:10:01.900 align:start position:0%
What is it?

00:10:01.933 --> 00:10:03.669
Hold on.

00:10:03.702 --> 00:10:05.104
What's this...
what's this waterfall called?

00:10:05.137 --> 00:10:06.338 align:start position:0%
Gullfoss.

00:10:06.371 --> 00:10:07.906 align:start size:69% position:31%
- Gu...
- Gullfoss.

00:10:07.939 --> 00:10:09.742
Gul... Gullfoss.

00:10:09.775 --> 00:10:11.110
All right, thanks, cheers.

00:10:12.978 --> 00:10:15.014
The Gull...

00:10:15.047 --> 00:10:18.684 align:start size:75% position:25%
The Gull... what he said
waterfall, okay?

00:10:18.717 --> 00:10:21.220 align:start size:50% position:50%
The what-he-said
waterfall.

00:10:21.253 --> 00:10:23.022 align:start position:0%
And we're gonna put the camera
back on the drone,

00:10:23.055 --> 00:10:25.324 align:start position:0%
and get some lovely slow-mo
shots of the water.

00:10:25.357 --> 00:10:27.126 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Yeah.
- We know him,
  don't worry about it.

00:10:27.159 --> 00:10:28.361
Come on.

00:10:37.703 --> 00:10:39.038 align:start size:63% position:38%
That is so far away.

00:10:39.071 --> 00:10:40.272 align:start size:44% position:56%
Dan: It's far.

00:10:41.373 --> 00:10:43.976
<i> ( music playing )</i>

00:11:09.868 --> 00:11:12.104
Gav:<i> The sun is setting on
 another lovely day of slow-mo.</i>

00:11:12.137 --> 00:11:13.906
<i> That was actually
 an interesting one because,</i>

00:11:13.939 --> 00:11:16.241
even though it didn't require
anything from us subject wise,

00:11:16.274 --> 00:11:19.178 align:start position:0%
we decided to film it in
the most difficult way possible.

00:11:19.211 --> 00:11:21.413 align:start position:0%
Yeah, let's just put
the Phantom in the sky
and film it from there.

00:11:21.446 --> 00:11:23.449 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Yeah.
- And it may have got
  a little bit wet,

00:11:23.482 --> 00:11:25.484
but thankfully
we still got a Phantom

00:11:25.517 --> 00:11:26.919
and a lovely drone.

00:11:26.952 --> 00:11:28.287
Hopefully you enjoyed
that video.

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:29.955
Feel free to subscribe
to the Slow Mo Guys

00:11:29.988 --> 00:11:31.423
and check out part two

00:11:31.456 --> 00:11:32.991
and other episodes
of "Planet Slow Mo."

00:11:33.024 --> 00:11:35.094
Thank you very much
for watching.

00:11:35.127 --> 00:11:36.128
Bloody love Iceland.

00:11:36.161 --> 00:11:37.362 align:start size:75% position:25%
- It's gorgeous.
- Yeah.

00:11:37.395 --> 00:11:39.432 align:start position:0%
- So nice.
- Could stay here an extra day.

